                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.12155/456: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morrow</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-08-29T19:00:00-04:00">August 29, 1930—7
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>225. Department concurs in your views as expressed in final paragraph your 196,
                    August 28, 5 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
